{
    "reasoner_response": "Inform the customer: "Please keep in mind that this is the maximum limit listed in your contract. The actual coverage available to you will depend on your specific claim's authorization." Then, based on the contract, explain: "Your contract allows reimbursement for substitute transportation, including rental cars, ride-hailing, taxis, or public transit, up to $50 per day for a maximum of ten days while your vehicle is held by a repair facility for a covered repair. If your expenses exceed $50 per day, you are responsible for the difference." Do not mention any non-rental benefits or details. Ask if they would like to know more about the reimbursement process or have other rental-related questions.",
    "communication_rules": [
        "- If the customer tried to change the topic while you are waiting for Supervisor instructions, before following any Reasoner's instructions, ask the customer whether they want to switch to the new topic or continue with the current one.",
        "- If any previous requests were prevented from execution, they can now be re-evaluated and executed if appropriate. Make a new function/tool request to do so."
    ]
}
